    "twin": false,
    "text": "How do I open a cold call?"
   },
   {
    "who": "My twin",
    "twin": true,
    "text": "Say who you are and why you’re calling in one sentence, then offer one comparable sale."
   },
   {
    "who": "Nora",
    "twin": false,
    "text": "They say “not interested.”"
   },
   {
    "who": "My twin",
    "twin": true,
    "text": "Agree, then ask one question: “Would you like to know what the unit next door sold for?”"
   }
  ],
