   {
    "who": "Leo",
    "twin": false,
    "text": "My client paid the deposit. What now?"
   },
   {
    "who": "My twin",
    "twin": true,
    "text": "Send the payment plan with dates the same day, then book a short call for each milestone."
   },
   {
    "who": "Leo",
    "twin": false,
    "text": "The client asks why construction is delayed."
   },
   {
    "who": "My twin",
    "twin": true,
    "text": "Share what the developer has confirmed, what you are still waiting for, and the day you’ll update them next."
   },
   {
    "who": "Leo",
    "twin": false,
    "text": "What happens on handover day?"
   },
   {
    "who": "My twin",
    "twin": true,
    "text": "Snagging first, then keys. Bring a checklist and book a snagging slot a week early."
   }
  ],
